  "title": "CMake: Asciidoctor quiet is too quiet when failing on warnings",
  "description": "Asciidoctor --quiet silences log messages at WARN and below. This is\ntoo quiet when failing on WARN, because it doesn't print the error.\n\nThe Documentation job has been failing for the past three days due to\na GIF being added, but the following warning message was missing from\nthe logs, making it harder to diagnose the failure:\n\nasciidoctor: WARNING: GIF image format not supported. Install the prawn-gmagick gem or convert images/ws-aggregation-view-example.gif to PNG.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
